16:26:14.8983018+02:00: root Information: 0 : Cegid.Framework.Data | SqlService | [PGI] SELECT TOP 1 GHE_CODESITE,GHE_NUMERO,GHE_NIVEAU3,GHE_RESUME,GHE_DATECREATION,GHE_UTILISATEUR,GHE_CODESITE,GHS_EVENTSIGN,GHS_SIGNVERSION,CKY_SIGNKEYVERSION,CKY_CUSTOMERKEY
                            FROM JOURNALEVENT
