16:28:25.8328635+02:00: root Verbose: 0 : Cegid.Framework.Data | CallingFlow | Méthode 'Cegid.Erp.Data.Sql.SqlService.ExecuteCommand`1' - Etape 'Génération de la commande'
16:28:25.8328635+02:00: root Information: 0 : Cegid.Framework.Data | SqlService | [PGI] SELECT TOP 1 GHE_CODESITE,GHE_NUMERO,GHE_NIVEAU3,GHE_RESUME,GHE_DATECREATION,GHE_UTILISATEUR,GHE_CODESITE,GHS_EVENTSIGN,GHS_SIGNVERSION,CKY_SIGNKEYVERSION,CKY_CUSTOMERKEY
                            FROM JOURNALEVENT
                            LEFT JOIN JOURNALEVENTSIGN ON GHS_ETABLISSEMENT = GHE_CODESITE AND GHS_NUMERO = GHE_NUMERO
                            LEFT JOIN CUSTOMERKEY ON CKY_SIGNKEYVERSION = GHS_SIGNKEYVERSION
                            WHERE GHE_CODESITE = @param0
                                AND GHE_NUMERO &lt; @param1
                                AND GHE_NIVEAU3 IN ('CAI','EJ1','EJ2','EN0','EN2','EN4','EN5','EN6','ENB','JO1','OF4','OF5','OF6','OF7','P01','RE2','SO3','TM2','TM3','UT1','W01','W02','W03','W04','W05','W06','W07','W08','W09','W10','W11','W12','W13','W14','W15','W16','W17')
